# Opt-in live-harness E2E lab directories. Each suite builds its lab under the
# repo root and removes it on exit, but it exists for the minutes the live run
# takes, and it contains a full clone of this repo. Anyone running `git add -A`
# during a run would otherwise commit that embedded clone.
.claude-autoarm-live-e2e.*/
.codex-live-e2e.*/
.grok-live-e2e.*/
.opencode-live-e2e.*/
.pi-live-e2e.*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
config/
